The production map uses Leaflet and world-atlas/topojson packages under their
respective permissive licenses. Country-boundary data is derived from Natural
Earth public-domain map data. OpenStreetMap tiles are requested at runtime and
are not redistributed; the required OpenStreetMap contributor attribution is
displayed in the map UI.

The combined relay release generates an artifact-specific third-party notice
and license pack from the actual production bundle. That generated pack, not
this short first-party notice, is the authoritative dependency inventory for a
particular release artifact.
